Dear Lisa van Wyk,

I hope you are keeping well there at Jacaranda Panel Beaters.

On behalf of Bushveld Timber, I am sending our ordinary monthly invoice for October timber supplies delivered to your workshop during the month.

Please find attached invoice INV-66006 for R25 944.00, which lists the items, quantities and delivery notes for your records.

There are no changes from our side, and payment can simply go to the account on file as usual.

If anything on the invoice looks different from your delivery notes, please let me know and I will gladly check and send a corrected copy if needed.

Thank you for your continued support and for the friendly way your team receives our drivers.

Kind regards
Marike Botha
Bushveld Timber

